flowchart TB
User[Authenticated user goal] --> Ownership[Run ownership check]
Ownership --> Plan[Model planning when available]
Plan --> Registry[Registered tool schemas]
Registry --> Gate[Explicit allowed tools and permission gate]
Gate --> Execute[Bounded tool execution]
Execute --> Audit[Persisted owned audit history]
Cancel[Cancellation timeout and retry limits] --> Execute
Consequential[Consequential external action] -. separate approval required .-> Gate
Injection[Untrusted model or document text] -. cannot grant permission .-> Gate
